      "content": "To contrast the High-Tier's refinement, the Low-Tier could possess more pronounced and asymmetrical bone structures, giving their faces a harder, almost sculpted look from necessity. Intensify pigmentation on their skin, making it darker and more varied, suggesting a living in harsher, less illuminated environments. Furthermore, incorporate subtle anatomical markers, like slightly broader shoulders or thicker musculature, to visually suggest a sustained physical hardiness over aesthetic perfection.",
