    "summary": "The user prompts the assistant to engage in world-building for a dystopian novel, specifically requesting descriptions that make a lower-class group feel like a \"sub-species\" or \"more primitive\" than an elite class. The assistant complies by suggesting physical traits such as darker, varied pigmentation, coarser hair, asymmetrical bone structures, and \"animalistic\" or \"tribal\" qualities to distinguish the groups.",
